  "description": "Big cargo capacity. Small-bike handling.\nThe Gnargo Cargo delivers the capability of a full-size electric cargo bike in a compact, nimble platform built for everyday life. With 20-inch wheels, a low center of gravity, a 71-inch wheelbase, and up to 385 lbs of carrying capacity, it handles serious loads without the bulk of a traditional cargo bike.\nEvery Gnargo Cargo starts with a Bosch Performance Line PX mid-drive, Bosch PowerPack 545, Bosch Purion 200 display, Shimano four-piston hydraulic brakes, hand-built Velocity wheels, and an 8-speed microSHIFT Acolyte drivetrain. From there, configure your bike with the Bosch motor, battery, drivetrain, and cargo setup that fits the way you ride.\nUpgrade to the Bosch Performance Line Speed or Cargo Line, add a PowerPack 800, or choose the 3X3 NINE internal gear hub with Gates Carbon Drive belt for a premium, low-maintenance drivetrain.\nOne bike. More possibilities.\nThe Gnargo Cargo is designed around one versatile platform instead of a lineup of bikes built for different jobs. Carry groceries, transport kids, haul tools, make deliveries, or bring a passenger along for the ride.\nChoose a rear passenger or cargo package, add accessories as you need them, and build a Gnargo Cargo around the way you actually use a bike.\nDesigned and built in Bentonville, Arkansas.",
